poll (receive c), nothing sent  = None
poll (always 3)  = Some 3
sync (always a)  = "a"
sync (wrap (always 2) (x * 10))  = 20
sync (choose [receive c; always 5])  = 5
select [receive c; always 6]  = 6
receive from a sending thread  = 7
  the sender's sync  = sent
poll (send c 8) to a blocked receiver  = ok
  the receiver's sync  = 8
sequence [always 1; always 2]: sync, sync, poll  = 1 2 None
sequence_final [always 1; always 2]: sync x3  = 1 2 2
choose [recv; send] blocked, completed by a sender  = ok, the chooser's sync: received hello
choose [send; recv] blocked, completed by a sender  = ok, the chooser's sync: received hello
choose [recv; send] blocked, completed by a receiver  = ok, the chooser's sync: sent
choose [send; recv] blocked, completed by a receiver  = ok, the chooser's sync: sent
stderr lines written by sync (always 0)  = 0
stderr lines written by poll (receive c)  = 0
